OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FManchester City manager Enzo Maresca
OL,7,Fhas declared his unwavering support
OL,8,Ffor the club, insisting that the
OL,9,Frecent financial charges have not
OL,10,Ftainted the team's achievements.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the media on Friday 9
OL,13,FOctober, Maresca expressed full
OL,14,Fconfidence in City's ability to clear
OL,15,Ftheir name as they appeal against more
OL,16,Fthan 100 alleged breaches of Premier
OL,17,FLeague financial regulations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FMaresca said: "I completely trust, 100
OL,7,Fper cent, the owner, the CEO, the
OL,8,Fsporting director, the whole
OL,9,Forganisation,
OL,11,F"There is not another club in the
OL,12,Fworld where I would like to be. I am
OL,13,Fvery happy to be here, I am very
OL,14,Fproud, as I've said since day one."
OL,16,FThe 46-year-old, who succeeded Pep
OL,17,FGuardiola in the summer, maintained
OL,18,Fthat he would have accepted the City
OL,19,Fjob even if the charges had been
OL,20,Fpublic knowledge at the time.
OL,26,@nD@OOUsD@AOUvD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FHe emphasised his commitment to the
OL,7,Fclub but refrained from commenting on
OL,8,Fhis future should the appeal fail.
OL,10,FHe said: "I would like to speak about
OL,11,Fthis situation when we are going to
OL,12,Fwin the appeal. I completely trust the
OL,13,Fclub in this moment, in the future,
OL,14,Falways."
OL,16,FMaresca's comments come as City face
OL,17,Fthe prospect of heavy sanctions,
OL,18,Fincluding significant points
OL,19,Fdeductions or even demotion, if the
OL,20,Fappeal is unsuccessful.
OL,26,@rD@JOUvD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FThe Italian manager, however, refused
OL,7,Fto speculate about the future,
OL,8,Fstating: "I'm worried about tomorrow,
OL,9,Fin two days, three days, I don't know
OL,10,Fwhat is happening in the future.
OL,12,F"It is fair, from my point of view,
OL,13,Ffrom all of us, to respect the
OL,14,Fprocess. There is an appeal ongoing.
OL,15,FWe will see what happens."
OL,17,FThe press conference, originally
OL,18,Fintended to preview Sunday's crucial
OL,19,FPremier League clash with Liverpool,
OL,20,Fwas dominated by questions about the
OL,21,Fcharges.
OL,26,@pD@JOUwD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FDespite the intense scrutiny, 45
OL,7,Fjournalists were in attendance, far
OL,8,Fmore than usual.
OL,10,FMaresca answered openly and directly,
OL,11,Fwith no attempts by the club to
OL,12,Fmoderate the discussion.
OL,14,FAddressing concerns over the
OL,15,Flegitimacy of City's past successes,
OL,16,Fparticularly the 2023 treble during
OL,17,Fwhich he served as a member of
OL,18,FGuardiola's backroom staff.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FMaresca said: "Absolutely not. The
OL,7,Flast time I was here was the treble
OL,8,Fseason. I know the efforts from the
OL,9,Fplayers, from the club, from the
OL,10,Fmanager at that time, Pep, so I know
OL,11,Fthe effort the club put in to achieve
OL,12,Fthat target. I don't have any doubts
OL,13,Fabout that."
OL,15,FCity's hierarchy has consistently
OL,16,Fasserted their innocence, claiming to
OL,17,Fpossess a "comprehensive body of
OL,18,Firrefutable evidence" supporting their
OL,19,Fcase.
OL,26,@nD@OOUuD@LO]yD@KOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FDespite the seriousness of the
OL,7,Fcommission's findings, which included
OL,8,Fallegations of concealing over #830
OL,9,Fmillion in funding across nine years,
OL,10,FMaresca remains focused on football.
OL,12,FHe said: "We understand the
OL,13,Fseriousness of the situation, we
OL,14,Funderstand the noise completely, 100
OL,15,Fper cent. It's something serious, but
OL,16,Fat the same time, we just need to
OL,17,Fmanage that and focus on what we can
OL,18,Fdo, what we can control, and that is
OL,19,Ftry to prepare for the game in the
OL,20,Fbest way, try to go to Anfield and win
OL,21,Fthe game."
OL,26,@tD@JOU}D@JO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FLooking ahead to the high-stakes match
OL,7,Fat Anfield, Maresca acknowledged the
OL,8,Fchallenging environment but expressed
OL,9,Fconfidence in his squad's mental
OL,10,Fstrength.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FHe said: "I know Anfield is a nice
OL,7,Fpitch. It will probably be more warm
OL,8,Fin terms of environment, but the
OL,9,Freason I decided to be manager is for
OL,10,Fthis kind of game. Absolutely they can
OL,11,Fface the pressure. We have players who
OL,12,Fhave already experienced a similar
OL,13,Fsituation, (such as) Enzo Fernandez
OL,14,Fplaying in Argentina. In Argentina,
OL,15,Fit's almost every game going to
OL,16,FAnfield, so no problem."
OL,26,@nD@JOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,FLiverpool boss Andoni Iraola said: "I
OL,7,Fthink uncertainty is not good for
OL,8,Fanyone involved but there is the
OL,9,Fprocess ongoing and we have to be
OL,10,Fpatient like everyone else and see
OL,11,Fwhat happens at the end.
OL,13,F"No one knows what's going to happen.
OL,14,FWe have to focus on Liverpool and
OL,15,Fbeing the best club we can be, the
OL,16,Fbest team we can be. That's my
OL,17,Fchallenge. My opinion is not valid
OL,18,Fbecause I haven't spent that time and
OL,19,FI haven't read as much as they've (the
OL,20,Fcommission) done.
OL,26,@nD@dOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791571696
OL,3,CEnzo Maresca reaffirms trust in
OL,4,CManchester City
OL,6,F"I think the challenge of the game is
OL,7,Fso high that I don't think players
OL,8,Fthink too much outside of this. They
OL,9,Fare thinking 'I have to mark this
OL,10,Fplayer' or 'I have to go and deal with
OL,11,Fthis one' or 'I have be at this level
OL,12,Fbecause the level of the game is so
OL,13,Fhigh'. They will be focused on those
OL,14,Fthings. Obviously they will have their
OL,15,Fown opinions but I think they will be
OL,16,Ffully focused on what happens on the
OL,17,Fpitch."
OL,26,@yD@GO]
